<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56072" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατόπτ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατοπτήρ</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				372
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one who visits</i> or <i>explores</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλιμάτων καὶ ἐθνῶν</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				330.15
			</span></i>; <i>one who contemplates</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
				</span></i>
			 Bybl. ap. <i><span class="en">
				Eus.
				<u>PE</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>overseer</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατόπτης δ᾽ εἴμ᾽ ἐγὼ τῶν πραγμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					41
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ Ζεῦ διόπτα καὶ κατόπτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					435
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατόπτας, ὁ</span>, title of an officer in 
				Boeot.
			 towns, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.303.21
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Oropus</span>), <i><span class="en">
				3172.140
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Orchomenus</span>).</div>
